sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Outbox worker
    participant DB as Database
    participant M as Email server

    Note over DB: Letter, code, outbox row and audit entry were saved together. Outbox status is PENDING.
    W->>DB: claim one due PENDING row with a row lock
    DB-->>W: outbox row and letter details
    W->>M: send letter email with a timeout
    alt email accepted
        M-->>W: accepted
        W->>DB: outbox SENT, request Delivered, audit entry in one transaction
    else server down or timeout
        W->>DB: attempts + 1, save last_error, set next_attempt_at using backoff
        Note over DB: Letter and verification code stay valid. The student already has the letter details.
        W->>DB: later, claim the same row again when it is due
        W->>M: send letter email again
        alt retry limit reached
            W->>DB: outbox FAILED, request DeliveryFailed, audit entry
            Note over DB: Staff are alerted. A resend puts the row back to PENDING.
        end
    end
